        "id": 22269
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-14T07:48:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As mentioned and discussed in https://github.com/signalapp/Signal-Desktop/issues/6031, skia library includes by default this ICC profile which should not be included by default.",
      "revId": "7556aafc332619747f16c080d22e98a0c00b3c60",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
